ategory_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"M8ONtZM80_LYC2Q3iqU5SA","review_id":"BrPmati2KW9IKZ_rfvIGOQ","date":"2008-11-08T19:18:26","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9428393244743347,"text_excerpt":"An excellent dining experience is the only way I can describe a recent dinner here. The restaurant is actually in a pretty swank and relatively unknown hotel (Pere Marquette), but walking through the lobby to the hotel, I was literally mesmerized the textures and colors of the decor of the place. The restaurant was equally visually stimulating. After ordering food and selecting the wine (kudos for bringing us the proper glasses for our tasty pinot noir), we were brought an amuse bouche - bacon wrapped shrimp. Now that is a really lovely way to start of the evening - bacon and shrimp. I ordered the Oyster Rockefeller \"Deconstructed\" (Poached Louisiana Oysters, Spinach, Bacon Chips, Licoric..."},{"business_id":"M8ONtZM80_LYC2Q3iqU5SA","review_id":"SHJiuMBenW8LluCVLzByXA","date":"2013-11-08T16:05:47","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9418960809707642,"text_excerpt":"I've eaten here twice and loved it both times. The first time, we ate from the bar menu. The bartender was very attentive and gave great suggestions on food and wine pairings. The lamb burger was so moist and flavorful. The combo of bread, cheese, and onion with the lamb was amazing! My second visit was in the dining room and was no less wonderful. The sweet breads and oyster salad are absolutely delicious! The barbecued lobster was also spectacular and just the right amount of punch so it didn't overpower the delicate lobster. I had the much touted about baby chicken and practically licked the plate. (okay, I actually did, a little. Ssshh...) ;) My friend had the NY strip with asparagus ..."},{"business_id":"M8ONtZM80_LYC2Q3iqU5SA","review_id":"8lJY1cb8wvj_vHjwWKxXkg","date":"2010-01-25T00:46:37","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9404747486114502,"text_excerpt":"Went here with a dinner group last night. Can I just say WOW? The service was pretty darn great without being patronizing. The amuse-bouche of curry coconut shrimp they brought us was fantastic, although we were a little miffed that the three vegetarians with us didn't get something similar. An excellent green soup followed--I think it was broccoli but can't be certain because their website is down at the moment. My main dish of pork cheeks was UNBELIEVABLE, so tender you could cut it with your fork, SO GOOD I even ate the brussels sprouts around it and I don't like brussels sprouts. Dessert was a vanilla rice pudding that was cool, fresh and wonderful. My last few experiences with \"conce..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"M8ONtZM80_LYC2Q3iqU5SA","photo_id":"NR2WiORpQdgVqDWb4erQiQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/NR2WiORpQdgVqDWb4erQiQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9281865954399109},{"business_id":"M8ONtZM80_LYC2Q3iqU5SA","photo_id":"QRzJBXnQyC_Aav5gIFneEQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/QRzJBXnQyC_Aav5gIFneEQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8326507806777954},{"business_id":"M8ONtZM80_LYC2Q3iqU5SA","photo_id":"NEdRittYZrFFiBNlkWvuHw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/NEdRittYZrFFiBNlkWvuHw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8274134397506714},{"business_id":"M8ONtZM80_LYC2Q3iqU5SA","photo_id":"v6gd7IIKJXjU-oNuc_xMFQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/v6gd7IIKJXjU-oNuc_xMFQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.821273684501648},{"business_id":"M8ONtZM80_LYC2Q3iqU5SA","photo_id":"7guD2R1fII99Q6dhoRW0FA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/7guD2R1fII99Q6dhoRW0FA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.792980432510376}]},"notebook_case":null}
